 "notes": "The old ferry harbour at Anna Jacobapolder on the Zijpe: the rope entry to the mussel hang culture inside the harbour, the stairs on the north arm for the dive outside along the slope, depth contours from 5 to 30 m, the usual routes, the no-dive zone at the channel and the Veenplaten to the north-east. Harbour outline, shoreline and buoy from OpenStreetMap. Tertius is the name of a dive boat, not a wreck; the football goal at 12 m and the sepia racks reported at the site are not placed. Positions are approximate.",
